<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="devui.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="devui">
    <!-- Tier 8 slice 1 — RmlUi dev-panel FOUNDATION (parallel preview; the ImGui F4
         panel stays primary + fully live). Proves form-control two-way data-binding:
         each <input type="checkbox" data-checked="..."> binds to a *_rmlui_enabled() bool
         (bound BY POINTER in C++), so clicking a box toggles the real screen live, and
         ImGui-side changes reflect back here (C++ DirtyAllVariables each tick). Slice 2
         expands to the full ~35-toggle registry + the first <input type="range"> slider;
         later slices port the lighting tuning controls; finally F4 opens this and ImGui
         is retired (§8). -->
    <div class="devui-panel">
        <div class="devui-title">RmlUi dev panel — preview (slice 1)</div>
        <div class="devui-section">Core widgets</div>
        <label class="devui-row"><input type="checkbox" value="1" data-checked="uilist"/> uilist</label>
        <label class="devui-row"><input type="checkbox" value="1" data-checked="query_popup"/> query_popup</label>
        <label class="devui-row"><input type="checkbox" value="1" data-checked="string_input"/> string_input</label>
        <div class="devui-section">Sidebar</div>
        <label class="devui-row"><input type="checkbox" value="1" data-checked="sidebar_hud"/> sidebar HUD</label>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
